I'm 28.
I'm a teacher.


00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.683
Okay. Teacher.


00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.842
And how long have you guys been married?


00:00:58.920 --> 00:00:59.921
10 years.


00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.885
Okay.
At least we're in agreement about that.


00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.050
