00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:10.322
<i>Judith was so worried
when Brice asked for her hand in marriage.</i>


00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:12.204
<i>She just knew her mother would say, "No."</i>


00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:14.169
