00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:35.201
<i>At last, they were together.</i>


00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.802
<i>And life began.</i>


00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:53.887
<i>They found this cute little place together.</i>


00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:55.161
I won! No, I won!


00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:58.409
