Okay?


00:31:36.120 --> 00:31:37.326
Can I eat?


00:31:38.040 --> 00:31:39.166
Thank you.


00:31:42.400 --> 00:31:45.085
We could fluff the pillows, turn off the lamps.


00:31:45.280 --> 00:31:47.408
You know, do it the way we always do.


00:31:47.840 --> 00:31:49.604
<i>It's going to be a great day</i>


00:31:49.720 --> 00:31:50.926
<i>if you're planning on being outdoors.</i>


00:31:51.000 --> 00:31:53.367
<i>So if you don't have to be
at work, or even if you do,</i>


00:31:53.560 --> 00:31:56.166
<i>make sure you get outside
and enjoy the warm weather.</i>


00:31:56.360 --> 00:32:01.048
<i>As we are experiencing some
really nice above seasonal weather.</i>


00:32:01.760 --> 00:32:03.842
<i>You can expect sunny highs in the mid-70s</i>


00:32:03.920 --> 00:32:06.730
