00:32:11.680 --> 00:32:14.684
<i>Now, this high pressure
is moving in from the southwest</i>


00:32:14.760 --> 00:32:18.287
<i>and it should be expected
to stay with us for the next couple of days.</i>


00:32:24.640 --> 00:32:25.801
Good morning.


00:32:26.760 --> 00:32:27.886
Morning.


00:32:27.960 --> 00:32:29.007
How are you?


00:32:29.200 --> 00:32:30.531
Good.


00:32:32.040 --> 00:32:34.202
Mmm. You knocked me out last night.


00:32:34.400 --> 00:32:35.526
Hmm. I know.


00:32:36.120 --> 00:32:39.329
I didn't do my job too well,
if you're already up and running.


00:32:41.960 --> 00:32:44.691
Just going for
a Saturday morning run. See you later.


00:33:08.120 --> 00:33:09.451
Hmm.


00:33:10.720 --> 00:33:12.449
Imagine me running into you.


00:33:12.640 --> 00:33:15.530
What did you say? I'm sorry, I can't hear you.


00:33:28.960 --> 00:33:30.007
What?


00:33:30.680 --> 00:33:31.966
What? Huh?


00:33:32.160 --> 00:33:33.924
That's the trash-talking. That's what I hear.


00:33:34.000 --> 00:33:35.604
I'm pacing myself.


00:33:35.800 --> 00:33:37.689
Well, who's leaving who
in the dust?


00:33:37.880 --> 00:33:40.087
Hey, watch out, watch out! Oh!


00:33:40.280 --> 00:33:41.725
I'm so sorry.
You okay?


00:33:41.920 --> 00:33:43.081
What is your
problem, man? Huh? Huh?


00:33:43.160 --> 00:33:44.366
I didn't see you.


00:33:44.560 --> 00:33:45.971
Say something! You gonna
knock her down like that?


00:33:46.160 --> 00:33:47.321
You'll hurt him. Harley, wait, wait!


00:33:47.520 --> 00:33:48.726
No, Harley. No.


00:33:48.960 --> 00:33:51.088
- Harley, I'm okay.
- Please! I'm really sorry.


00:33:51.160 --> 00:33:52.969
I'm okay. I'm okay. I'm okay.


00:33:53.160 --> 00:33:55.162
Just let him go. Just walk away.


00:33:55.360 --> 00:33:59.160
I'm okay. Okay? I'm fine. I'm fine.


00:33:59.640 --> 00:34:01.404
I'm okay. No, I'm okay.


00:34:02.160 --> 00:34:03.446
Let's get you up here.


00:34:03.680 --> 00:34:05.364
- Wait, wait, wait.
- That's good.


00:34:05.480 --> 00:34:06.527
Let me go slow.


00:34:06.920 --> 00:34:08.001
Ooh. Wait, wait.


00:34:08.080 --> 00:34:10.208
- Okay. All right, okay, this could be bad.
- Wait, wait, wait.


00:34:10.280 --> 00:34:11.281
Let me call my husband.


00:34:11.480 --> 00:34:12.527
No, I live close by here.


00:34:12.600 --> 00:34:13.647
No,no,no.


00:34:13.720 --> 00:34:15.449
No, I'll wrap it up,
I'll call my neighbor, he's a doctor.


00:34:15.520 --> 00:34:16.965
Okay, all right, but I still
have to call, because...


00:34:17.040 --> 00:34:18.644
No, either way, we gotta get your leg...


00:34:18.720 --> 00:34:21.724
- No, no, no! Put me back down.
- No, listen, ssh! Hey!


