I got you. Okay? All right.


00:34:36.560 --> 00:34:37.891
You good?


00:34:37.960 --> 00:34:39.007
Yeah.


00:34:39.240 --> 00:34:41.846
Wow, this, this place is just incredible.


00:34:42.040 --> 00:34:43.201
