00:35:10.640 --> 00:35:12.802
Well, you're pretty good at it.


00:35:13.360 --> 00:35:17.922
Yeah, it's just
a little something I picked up in college.


00:35:18.280 --> 00:35:20.169
- Oh, yeah?
- Yeah.


