00:35:25.280 --> 00:35:26.281
Really?


00:35:26.880 --> 00:35:28.689
- Mm-hm.
- Hmm.


00:35:30.200 --> 00:35:32.009
You talk about him a lot.


00:35:33.800 --> 00:35:36.246
It's kinda what you do when you're married.


00:35:37.040 --> 00:35:41.443
When he comes up, it's
kinda in comparison to me.


00:35:44.200 --> 00:35:45.770
No, it's not.


00:35:46.320 --> 00:35:48.163
Yeah, it actually is.


00:35:48.520 --> 00:35:52.127
You wouldn't be comparing us, would you?


00:35:53.200 --> 00:35:54.486
Why would I do that?


00:35:55.160 --> 00:35:56.446
Well, you tell me.


00:35:57.560 --> 00:35:59.881
Okay, my husband
is not up for discussion.


00:36:00.080 --> 00:36:01.127
Well, you bring him up a lot.


00:36:01.320 --> 00:36:02.526
No, I do not.


00:36:06.440 --> 00:36:08.363
Okay. I'm sorry.


00:36:08.600 --> 00:36:12.889
I shouldn't have said anything about... Um...


00:36:14.960 --> 00:36:17.691
Look, it's just that,


00:36:18.960 --> 00:36:20.644
on one hand,


00:36:21.560 --> 00:36:23.528
I really wonder who this guy is.


00:36:23.720 --> 00:36:27.327
And how special he must be
to have gotten you.


00:36:27.720 --> 00:36:30.644
And on the other hand,
I wonder, does he even know it.


00:36:32.640 --> 00:36:35.610
I wonder if he challenges you mentally.


00:36:35.800 --> 00:36:38.167
Does he bring out the best in you?


00:36:38.560 --> 00:36:40.562
Does he even
notice you anymore?


00:36:40.800 --> 00:36:41.847
You know what? I'm not...


00:36:41.920 --> 00:36:42.921
- Judith, listen.


00:36:43.120 --> 00:36:44.485
Just listen.


00:36:45.320 --> 00:36:48.369
If I had a woman as beautiful as you,


00:36:49.600 --> 00:36:51.250
I wouldn't miss a thing.


00:36:53.480 --> 00:36:59.010
Like the small blonde hairs
on the back of your neck.


00:37:00.200 --> 00:37:02.567
Or how


00:37:03.360 --> 00:37:06.603
