00:37:14.760 --> 00:37:15.761
Like right now.


00:37:18.760 --> 00:37:22.924
That is very sexy. How slow you're breathing.


00:37:30.920 --> 00:37:32.888
Well, I don't miss anything either.


00:37:34.800 --> 00:37:39.840
Like the smell of jasmine
perfume on this sofa that's obviously fresh.


00:37:40.960 --> 00:37:44.646
Or those pair of high heels in your bedroom.


00:37:45.720 --> 00:37:48.326
