- No problem.


00:38:43.800 --> 00:38:46.485
Thanks a lot, Harley, I'll see you later.


00:38:46.960 --> 00:38:48.883
Yeah. Nice to meet you.


00:38:49.160 --> 00:38:51.288
Likewise. Thanks again.


00:38:51.680 --> 00:38:53.011
It's, you know,
it's just...


