Harley's here. Come on, we gotta go.


00:41:58.840 --> 00:42:00.330
Enough with the coffee. No coffee breath.


00:42:00.520 --> 00:42:01.681
Come on. No, no. Nope.


00:42:03.240 --> 00:42:04.287
