00:42:26.560 --> 00:42:28.562
Yeah, no worries. You changed your hair!


00:42:30.800 --> 00:42:32.006
Little bit.


00:42:32.320 --> 00:42:33.606
I like it.


00:42:34.600 --> 00:42:35.886
Thank you.


00:42:36.720 --> 00:42:38.006
Happy birthday.


00:42:38.960 --> 00:42:40.371
Thank you.


00:42:40.920 --> 00:42:42.251
You like the flowers?


00:42:46.280 --> 00:42:47.566
You sent these?


00:42:48.360 --> 00:42:50.647
Yeah.
Don't look so disappointed.


00:42:52.160 --> 00:42:54.288
No, it's just, um...


00:42:54.480 --> 00:42:55.970
It just said "Happy birthday, Judith."


00:42:56.040 --> 00:42:57.883
