00:42:58.080 --> 00:42:59.411
No, I wanted to tell you in person.


00:42:59.600 --> 00:43:01.489
I was gonna deliver them
myself when I came up,


00:43:01.720 --> 00:43:04.166
but I just didn't really
think that was a good idea.


00:43:05.240 --> 00:43:08.244
Oh, yeah. Uh-huh. Smart man.


00:43:08.680 --> 00:43:09.727
Yes.


00:43:09.800 --> 00:43:13.122
Okay. Come here for a second. Let's sit down.


00:43:16.360 --> 00:43:17.361
Have a seat.


00:43:17.440 --> 00:43:18.487
All right.


00:43:19.800 --> 00:43:22.724
Harley, I'm gonna be as honest as I can be.


