00:43:34.240 --> 00:43:35.287
Why?


00:43:35.880 --> 00:43:39.726
Judith, I find you extremely beautiful, okay?


00:43:39.920 --> 00:43:45.962
And interesting. And if I have to come here
myself to be around you, I will.


00:43:46.160 --> 00:43:49.209
I just wanna be involved with you. intimately.


00:43:49.640 --> 00:43:53.008
And as long as you know
that I'm very married...


00:43:55.400 --> 00:43:56.606
Point taken.


00:43:57.560 --> 00:43:58.766
He loves you.


00:44:00.120 --> 00:44:01.645
I saw that when he picked you up.


00:44:02.760 --> 00:44:05.001
He's kinda regular. But lucky.


00:44:06.320 --> 00:44:08.368
You just don't impress me
as the type of person


00:44:08.560 --> 00:44:10.847
that would be satisfied with a man like that.


00:44:12.080 --> 00:44:14.765
Maybe at one point in time, in your life.


00:44:15.000 --> 00:44:16.764
But where you're going,


00:44:17.440 --> 00:44:19.249
I just don't see that lasting.


00:44:27.320 --> 00:44:28.685
You don't know him.


00:44:43.280 --> 00:44:44.406
Hi.


00:44:44.520 --> 00:44:45.601
Hey-


00:44:46.320 --> 00:44:47.845
Crazy day today.


00:44:48.080 --> 00:44:49.081
Yeah?


00:44:50.600 --> 00:44:51.806
Yeah.


00:44:52.520 --> 00:44:55.046
I was trying to finish up all that inventory.


00:45:16.720 --> 00:45:18.370
Babe, I'm sorry.


00:45:23.320 --> 00:45:25.846
It's the second year in a row, Brice.


00:45:27.640 --> 00:45:30.723
Babe, I just got a little
carried away with work, that's all.


00:45:32.040 --> 00:45:35.203
Yeah. I understand. It's all good.


00:45:36.080 --> 00:45:38.401
No, no, let me take you out or something.


00:45:38.600 --> 00:45:44.721
No. I have this really big
assignment for work and I got a lot to do.


00:45:46.360 --> 00:45:47.964
Babe, I'm sorry.


00:45:49.680 --> 00:45:51.330
Brice, it's okay.


00:45:52.720 --> 00:45:54.085
Don't worry about it.


00:46:26.320 --> 00:46:29.051
<i>She may be weary</i>


