<i>Try a little tenderness</i>


00:46:54.680 --> 00:46:56.045
<i>Yeah, yeah</i>


00:46:57.480 --> 00:46:58.561
<i>Oh, now, now</i>


00:47:02.080 --> 00:47:04.242
<i>You won't regret it
No, no</i>


00:47:06.880 --> 00:47:08.848
<i>Young girls
They don't forget it</i>


00:47:09.280 --> 00:47:14.491
<i>Love is their own happiness</i>


00:47:14.880 --> 00:47:16.450
You're silly.


