<i>But it's all so easy</i>


00:47:24.480 --> 00:47:26.289
<i>All you gotta do is try</i>


00:47:26.840 --> 00:47:30.242
<i>Try a little tenderness</i>


00:47:31.240 --> 00:47:34.642
<i>All you got to do is, man</i>


00:47:34.720 --> 00:47:36.802
<i>Hold her when you wanna</i>


00:47:38.160 --> 00:47:39.764
Happy birthday, baby.


00:47:40.360 --> 00:47:41.805
I'm sorry.


00:47:50.600 --> 00:47:53.809
All right, girls,
let's make some dreams happen.


00:47:55.360 --> 00:48:00.207
Judith, you have been requested
to accompany Harley


00:48:00.280 --> 00:48:01.930
to New Orleans for a meeting.


00:48:02.720 --> 00:48:03.721
Oh. Really?


00:48:03.920 --> 00:48:05.922
Yes. He's presenting to his shareholders


00:48:06.120 --> 00:48:07.884
and he wants you there.


00:48:08.720 --> 00:48:10.882
Oh. Okay, well, when do we leave?


00:48:11.080 --> 00:48:13.447
Oh, no, darling, just you.


00:48:13.760 --> 00:48:15.364
I think he likes you.


00:48:15.840 --> 00:48:20.243
Now, I know you're married,
but just flirt a little.


00:48:20.440 --> 00:48:22.966
Get the deal closed.
Don't compromise yourself.


00:48:23.160 --> 00:48:25.606
But just flirt.


00:48:27.120 --> 00:48:28.201
I understand.


00:48:29.040 --> 00:48:30.485
I know I don't know you very well,


00:48:30.720 --> 00:48:33.690
but I want you to know
exactly what you're getting yourself into.


00:48:36.480 --> 00:48:38.721
This is a big deal for me and this place.


00:48:38.920 --> 00:48:41.366
And I want it in the worst way.


00:48:42.200 --> 00:48:43.690
That being said,


00:48:44.160 --> 00:48:47.528
I will tell you like I tell
all my girls who go out with my guys.


00:48:48.040 --> 00:48:52.170
Be nice. Be aware. Have fun.


00:48:52.600 --> 00:48:55.524
But most of all, be careful.


00:48:56.880 --> 00:48:58.530
I know you're a smart girl,


00:48:59.280 --> 00:49:01.328
but this is another league you're in.


00:49:03.800 --> 00:49:05.040
Trust me.


00:49:18.080 --> 00:49:19.730
<i>A couple of
senatorial retirement</i>


00:49:19.800 --> 00:49:20.961
<i>- announcements this week,</i>


00:49:21.160 --> 00:49:25.165
<i>highlighting what has been
a gradual rolling back of the GOP's...</i>


00:49:25.360 --> 00:49:26.850
Hello. Can I help you?


00:49:27.040 --> 00:49:28.849
Hi.
Do you think you can tell me


00:49:28.920 --> 00:49:30.081
how to get to Johnson Jewelry?


00:49:30.320 --> 00:49:32.527
I'm a little turned around.
I'm kind of new in town.


00:49:32.600 --> 00:49:34.967
Oh, you want East Jefferson.


00:49:35.040 --> 00:49:37.202
This is West Jefferson.


00:49:37.400 --> 00:49:39.004
That's on the other side of town.


00:49:39.120 --> 00:49:40.246
Thank you.
Thank you so much.


00:50:03.160 --> 00:50:05.606
What? We're back to this again?


00:50:05.800 --> 00:50:07.643
Did you not have
a good birthday or something?


00:50:09.000 --> 00:50:10.081
Uh...


00:50:10.360 --> 00:50:12.044
My husband forgot.


00:50:13.360 --> 00:50:16.250
He forgot? I thought he
sent you flowers yesterday.


00:50:17.520 --> 00:50:19.329
No, they weren't from him.


00:50:20.400 --> 00:50:22.084
He didn't even remember.


00:50:22.760 --> 00:50:27.482
I mean, he tried. It's just
the second year in a row.


00:50:28.040 --> 00:50:29.405
You are forgettable.


00:50:29.800 --> 00:50:33.043
Honey, you have to make
a man remember you.


00:50:33.240 --> 00:50:35.686
I've tried to
give you my assistance, but you don't want it,


00:50:35.920 --> 00:50:37.126
so get out.


00:50:38.520 --> 00:50:40.170
All right, you win.


00:50:43.160 --> 00:50:44.605
- Win what?


00:50:45.440 --> 00:50:48.523
The hair, the makeup, the clothes.


00:50:49.120 --> 00:50:50.645
Do whatever you wanna do.


00:50:51.120 --> 00:50:53.521
Are you kidding? Oh, my God. Thank you.


00:50:53.720 --> 00:50:56.564
I have been dying
to get my hands on this hair.


00:50:56.760 --> 00:50:57.841
Come on. Come on.


00:51:11.920 --> 00:51:15.402
Look. Look at the bags,
the shoes, purses, everything.


00:51:15.600 --> 00:51:17.489
I dream of this room.


00:51:17.720 --> 00:51:18.881
Look at this.


00:51:19.080 --> 00:51:20.161
Where are we right now?


00:51:20.360 --> 00:51:23.091
This is the place that Janice sends the
girls that she's not happy with


00:51:23.280 --> 00:51:24.406
before, you know, she sets them up.


00:51:24.640 --> 00:51:27.962
So this is what I call Couture Heaven.


00:51:28.160 --> 00:51:29.571
All right, let's get started.


00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:31.081
Wow.


00:51:31.160 --> 00:51:33.003
There's so much
to do with you in so little time.


00:51:33.200 --> 00:51:34.850
What do you think of this?


00:51:35.920 --> 00:51:37.684
Wow. What kind of fabric is this?


00:51:37.880 --> 00:51:39.291
One that's never been on your back.


00:51:39.360 --> 00:51:40.805
It's called expensive.


00:51:42.680 --> 00:51:44.330
Good morning.
Good morning.


00:51:46.880 --> 00:51:47.881
What's wrong?


00:51:48.640 --> 00:51:50.449
Her ex came in here.


00:51:50.640 --> 00:51:51.926
Tell him, honey.


00:51:52.480 --> 00:51:54.482
I've been hiding from him.


00:51:55.240 --> 00:51:57.129
Running from him for years.


00:51:58.800 --> 00:52:02.168
Changed my name. I moved here and...


00:52:02.880 --> 00:52:04.609
I can't believe he's here.


00:52:08.120 --> 00:52:09.690
I'm gonna have to quit.


00:52:10.280 --> 00:52:12.009
Well, where are you gonna go?


00:52:13.080 --> 00:52:14.206
I don't know.


00:52:17.000 --> 00:52:18.650
I'm tired of starting over.


00:52:18.840 --> 00:52:21.366
Look, maybe he just
stumbled in here on accident.


00:52:21.640 --> 00:52:23.563
Do you know how many people
live in this city?


00:52:24.080 --> 00:52:27.641
You can't keep running from
someone your whole life.


00:52:28.880 --> 00:52:30.609
You don't understand.


00:52:32.240 --> 00:52:35.289
When we first met, he wined and dined me.


00:52:36.160 --> 00:52:40.131
Made me feel like I was the
luckiest woman in the world.


00:52:43.040 --> 00:52:47.887
Then things started to unravel.


00:52:50.560 --> 00:52:52.847
And I don't know if it was the drugs


00:52:53.040 --> 00:52:55.850
or if he was really mentally ill.


00:52:56.480 --> 00:52:58.608
He just started to change.


00:52:59.320 --> 00:53:02.642
And just became evil.


00:53:06.720 --> 00:53:08.688
Like he was two different people.


00:53:16.800 --> 00:53:18.404
He tried to kill me.


00:53:21.640 --> 00:53:23.927
I just can't see you being with a guy like that.


00:53:25.360 --> 00:53:28.011
Sometimes you never know
who you're married to.


00:53:29.040 --> 00:53:33.125
People start off one way
and end up somebody else.


00:53:33.560 --> 00:53:36.131
One night, he was on that couch...


00:53:36.320 --> 00:53:39.290
I ran and I never looked back after that.


00:53:40.840 --> 00:53:43.081
Look, Melinda, you can't quit.


00:53:43.400 --> 00:53:44.890
What am I supposed to do?


00:53:45.680 --> 00:53:46.761
We'll help you.


00:53:47.960 --> 00:53:50.406
We'll pick you up and drop you off.


00:53:51.800 --> 00:53:52.847
We?


00:53:53.440 --> 00:53:54.601
Miss Waco.


00:53:55.000 --> 00:53:56.047
What?


00:53:56.400 --> 00:53:57.561
I'll help you.


00:53:57.760 --> 00:54:00.047
Yeah, he'll protect you.


00:54:00.440 --> 00:54:02.204
Don't throw away
what you found here.


00:54:02.960 --> 00:54:05.042
Do you know what we all need?


00:54:06.600 --> 00:54:08.011
Is a Valium.


00:54:10.280 --> 00:54:13.284
I have a whole room full of them.


00:54:44.200 --> 00:54:45.247
Good morning.


00:54:45.480 --> 00:54:46.606
Thank you.


00:54:50.040 --> 00:54:51.610
Please watch your step.


00:55:02.400 --> 00:55:03.526
Hello.


00:55:04.920 --> 00:55:05.967
Hi.


00:55:06.920 --> 00:55:11.562
You gonna fly standing up
or you gonna have a seat?


00:55:13.560 --> 00:55:16.643
Yeah.  Right. I will.


00:55:19.360 --> 00:55:20.407
All right.


00:55:20.520 --> 00:55:24.081
So, is this your plane? Like, it all is?


00:55:24.280 --> 00:55:25.281
Like, all the parts and everything.


00:55:25.360 --> 00:55:26.361
Yeah.


00:55:27.920 --> 00:55:28.921
Wow. That's cool.


00:55:29.120 --> 00:55:30.690
You know, I was thinkin'.
When we leave New Orleans,


00:55:30.880 --> 00:55:34.123
maybe we can head over
to Paris. Or New York.


00:55:34.320 --> 00:55:35.924
All this work we're trying to focus on


00:55:36.000 --> 00:55:37.525
and you're talking about Paris and New York?


00:55:38.000 --> 00:55:41.402
If you were mine, you wouldn't have to work.


00:55:43.880 --> 00:55:46.008
If you were mine, you wouldn't
be on this plane right now.


00:55:46.200 --> 00:55:47.565
Your butt would be at a pharmacy.


00:55:47.760 --> 00:55:49.171
That's the handout for the board meeting.


00:55:50.040 --> 00:55:51.201
Champagne, sir?


00:55:52.920 --> 00:55:54.365
Oh. Thank you.


00:55:54.440 --> 00:55:55.566
- You're welcome.
- Mmm.


00:55:55.640 --> 00:55:56.641
Something for you?


00:55:56.720 --> 00:55:57.767
Thanks, I'm fine.


00:57:32.320 --> 00:57:33.731
Look at you.


00:57:35.200 --> 00:57:37.646
Champagne. Private jet.


00:57:40.120 --> 00:57:43.249
You look amazing, by the way.


00:57:44.120 --> 00:57:47.203
Man, this view is just incredible.


00:57:53.680 --> 00:57:54.841
What?


00:57:57.400 --> 00:57:59.562
It's just refreshing to see someone


00:57:59.760 --> 00:58:01.410
experience this side of life for the first time.


00:58:01.480 --> 00:58:04.165
You know? it is. it excites me.


00:58:04.480 --> 00:58:05.527
Whatever.


00:58:05.600 --> 00:58:09.924
You know you take people on this
plane all the time and excite them.


00:58:10.200 --> 00:58:13.283
Just my ex.


00:58:14.360 --> 00:58:16.806
This was no big deal for her.


00:58:18.000 --> 00:58:19.126
Huh.


00:58:21.360 --> 00:58:24.728
I really hate being taken for granted.


00:58:25.560 --> 00:58:26.641
Don't you?


00:58:28.800 --> 00:58:30.040
Yeah.


00:58:34.560 --> 00:58:37.040
How would that make you feel
when she would do that?


00:58:38.400 --> 00:58:41.051
The opposite of how this makes you feel.


00:58:43.360 --> 00:58:45.362
How does this make me feel?


00:58:49.760 --> 00:58:51.125
Special.


00:58:52.480 --> 00:58:53.845
Important.


00:58:55.480 --> 00:58:56.845
Wanted.


00:59:00.080 --> 00:59:01.286
Am I right?


00:59:04.080 --> 00:59:06.128
You should feel that way all the time.


00:59:06.320 --> 00:59:08.004
This stuff didn't matter to her.


00:59:08.520 --> 00:59:11.205
The more I tried, the more she shot me down.


00:59:14.560 --> 00:59:16.449
I think I just love too hard.


00:59:17.480 --> 00:59:19.244
I do. I fall.


00:59:20.400 --> 00:59:23.961
Before I know it, I'm just... I'm gone.


00:59:25.560 --> 00:59:26.925
What do you mean, "gone"?


00:59:27.240 --> 00:59:29.686
Just crazy.


00:59:29.920 --> 00:59:34.084
Crazy in love. You know?


00:59:34.280 --> 00:59:37.762
So I've learned to keep
my true feelings inside


00:59:37.960 --> 00:59:41.646
because most women
can't handle the kind of emotion that I bring.


00:59:43.280 --> 00:59:44.611
What does that mean?


00:59:45.240 --> 00:59:47.288
Well, I can come on really strong.


00:59:48.800 --> 00:59:50.211
How so?


00:59:52.080 --> 00:59:55.243
I want to make love to you. Right now.


00:59:59.880 --> 01:00:01.928
That's the kind of thing I'd say to her.


01:00:05.240 --> 01:00:08.210
You are so beautiful.


01:00:10.040 --> 01:00:11.246
Thank you.


01:00:16.200 --> 01:00:17.281
Uh...


01:00:19.320 --> 01:00:20.401
What?


01:00:20.480 --> 01:00:22.244
I was talking about my ex.


01:00:22.440 --> 01:00:26.001
But you are beautiful, though. You are.


01:00:27.440 --> 01:00:28.441
You are.


01:00:29.320 --> 01:00:30.526
Thank you.


01:00:31.920 --> 01:00:34.571
One compliment does deserve another.


01:00:38.760 --> 01:00:43.561
I think we are better off
just keeping it professional.


01:00:43.920 --> 01:00:45.763
You know we're way past that.


01:00:48.800 --> 01:00:51.883
I find myself very attracted to you.


01:00:53.640 --> 01:00:56.166
I find myself very married.


01:00:57.960 --> 01:01:01.601
Happily married, right?


01:01:06.440 --> 01:01:08.010
A guy can dream, right?


01:01:11.960 --> 01:01:14.281
I can't stop you from dreaming.


01:01:15.840 --> 01:01:17.365
What do you dream about?


01:01:25.240 --> 01:01:31.247
I used to dream about
helping people and starting my own practice.


01:01:31.320 --> 01:01:34.290
But I graduated college and reality hit.


01:01:34.920 --> 01:01:36.888
I don't really dream anymore.


01:01:38.840 --> 01:01:41.047
You know all that could easily be reality.


01:01:45.760 --> 01:01:47.285
What do you dream about?


01:01:49.280 --> 01:01:50.361
You.


01:01:56.880 --> 01:01:58.564
You ever dream about me?


01:02:02.480 --> 01:02:03.925
I have a husband.


01:02:05.640 --> 01:02:07.563
Yeah. I know.


01:02:10.240 --> 01:02:11.321
Do you want me?


01:02:27.320 --> 01:02:28.845
What are you doing?


01:02:30.240 --> 01:02:31.765
Harley, stop it.


01:02:32.160 --> 01:02:33.207
I don't want to.


01:02:33.840 --> 01:02:35.080
Harley, stop it.


01:02:35.280 --> 01:02:37.044
Please, Harley.


01:02:37.280 --> 01:02:39.044
Please. Stop.


01:02:40.240 --> 01:02:42.811
Get off of me. Get off of me!


01:02:43.000 --> 01:02:47.085
Get! Get off of me!


01:02:47.440 --> 01:02:48.885
Just stop!


01:02:49.080 --> 01:02:50.161
Stop it. Stop.


01:02:50.240 --> 01:02:51.241
- You stop.
- Stop it.


01:02:53.160 --> 01:02:55.049
Now you can say you resisted.


01:03:35.280 --> 01:03:36.281
Are you okay?


01:03:38.040 --> 01:03:39.963
I don't wanna ever see you again.


01:03:40.680 --> 01:03:43.081
If you need anything, Janice can help you.


01:03:43.560 --> 01:03:45.449
Okay, Judith, hold on a second, please.


01:03:45.520 --> 01:03:46.965
- I will not do this. I can't.
- Wait. Judith,


01:03:47.160 --> 01:03:48.207
are you sure about this? Wait a second.


01:03:48.280 --> 01:03:49.281
I mean it.


01:03:49.360 --> 01:03:52.807
Wait, wait. Let me talk to
you real quick. Hold on.


01:03:54.080 --> 01:03:56.560
Are you sure you want to do this? Really?


01:03:56.680 --> 01:03:57.681
Shh.


01:03:57.800 --> 01:03:58.801
Thank you, son.


01:03:58.880 --> 01:03:59.927
No problem.


01:04:00.440 --> 01:04:01.441
Judith.


01:04:02.440 --> 01:04:03.566
Hey-


01:04:05.560 --> 01:04:06.925
Mmm. Mmm.


01:04:07.840 --> 01:04:11.481
Um, Harley, you
remember my husband, Brice.


01:04:11.560 --> 01:04:12.721
Hey, how you doin', man?


01:04:13.760 --> 01:04:14.807
Hi.


01:04:15.560 --> 01:04:17.210
That is a beautiful car.


01:04:18.080 --> 01:04:19.206
Thank you.


01:04:22.160 --> 01:04:23.161
Hey, Mama.


01:04:23.880 --> 01:04:24.881
This your mother?


01:04:25.640 --> 01:04:26.721
Mm-hm.


01:04:27.360 --> 01:04:28.407
Harley.


01:04:30.520 --> 01:04:32.170
Reverend Sarah Ogalvee.


01:04:32.360 --> 01:04:33.407
It's a pleasure.


01:04:35.240 --> 01:04:38.562
Um. Thanks so much for the
ride, Harley. Appreciate that.


01:04:40.320 --> 01:04:41.606
Okay. Y'all have a good night.


01:04:41.760 --> 01:04:43.000
Yeah.
Let's get you in, Miss Sarah.


01:04:43.240 --> 01:04:44.241
All right, son.


01:04:44.720 --> 01:04:45.721
Hi, Mom.


01:04:46.000 --> 01:04:48.048
<i>Sweetheart, 'new you Gem"?</i>


01:04:48.240 --> 01:04:49.401
You made it, huh?


01:04:49.480 --> 01:04:51.005
So happy to see you.


01:05:53.640 --> 01:05:57.531
Sweetness, that was
an awfully pretty dress I saw you in earlier.


01:05:58.320 --> 01:05:59.685
Oh. Uh...


01:06:00.080 --> 01:06:01.241
Yeah, you looked nice, babe.


01:06:01.440 --> 01:06:02.441
Thanks.


01:06:02.560 --> 01:06:04.210
My boss gave it to me.


01:06:04.280 --> 01:06:06.362
She wants us to start dressing like that.


01:06:06.520 --> 01:06:07.601
Hmm.


01:06:08.680 --> 01:06:10.205
You're not gonna say grace?


01:06:12.920 --> 01:06:14.729
Oh. Okay, yeah.


01:06:16.320 --> 01:06:17.765
God, thank you for this food.


01:06:17.880 --> 01:06:20.360
Bless it and purify it.
In Jesus' name we pray. Amen.


01:06:20.560 --> 01:06:24.849
In Jesus' name we pray.
And we thank you, Lord. Amen.


01:06:24.920 --> 01:06:26.001
Amen.


01:06:26.400 --> 01:06:28.448
Miss Sarah, I'm
always happy when you're around.


01:06:28.640 --> 01:06:29.971
I get to have a home-cooked meal.


01:06:30.160 --> 01:06:32.162
Daughter, you not cooking
for your husband?


01:06:35.240 --> 01:06:36.526
Yes, I am.


01:06:38.880 --> 01:06:42.043
Well, she does, but lately,
she's been working a lot.


01:06:42.320 --> 01:06:45.688
Right. With the man in the red, fast car?


01:06:46.280 --> 01:06:49.011
No. I mean, I don't work with him that often.


01:06:49.200 --> 01:06:50.884
And you know, he's a nice guy.


01:06:50.960 --> 01:06:52.007
Nice guy?


01:06:52.640 --> 01:06:54.768
That don't mean nothin'
if he don't know the Lord.


01:06:56.440 --> 01:06:58.090
"It's easier for a camel


01:06:58.200 --> 01:07:00.089
"to enter into the eye of a needle


01:07:00.320 --> 01:07:02.243
"than it is for a rich man


01:07:02.320 --> 01:07:05.210
"to enter into the kingdom of heaven."


01:07:06.040 --> 01:07:08.805
Yes, Mama, I know. You say that a lot.


01:07:09.200 --> 01:07:12.761
But there's nothing wrong
with being rich or having nice things.


01:07:13.000 --> 01:07:15.321
Long as nice things don't have you.


01:07:15.760 --> 01:07:16.761
Amen.


01:07:17.280 --> 01:07:19.203
Well, our business is over anyway so...


01:07:19.400 --> 01:07:21.004
Well,
then that's good, isn't it?


01:07:21.800 --> 01:07:23.928
Yeah. Uh-huh.


01:07:24.360 --> 01:07:25.441
You know, baby,


01:07:26.280 --> 01:07:27.406
it's been a long time


01:07:27.520 --> 01:07:29.488
since you been to the house of the Lord.


01:07:32.880 --> 01:07:35.963
I told her we rest on Sundays.


01:07:37.800 --> 01:07:38.847
Huh.


01:07:39.640 --> 01:07:42.484
You know, with your job,
you need to be in church.


01:07:42.680 --> 01:07:44.523
Could build spiritual strength up


01:07:44.600 --> 01:07:46.364
to deal with those demons, girl.


01:07:47.640 --> 01:07:49.369
I don't work with demons.


01:07:49.600 --> 01:07:51.762
Isn't that what you said to me on the phone?


01:07:52.960 --> 01:07:54.246
I know, but...


01:07:54.440 --> 01:07:56.363
Okay, I guess I was wrong.


01:07:56.560 --> 01:07:58.483
Mama, not everybody's a demon.


01:07:58.760 --> 01:08:00.569
Well, I know that.


01:08:01.080 --> 01:08:03.287
I'm just voicing my concern.


01:08:03.440 --> 01:08:05.204
We don't talk anymore.


01:08:06.000 --> 01:08:08.731
You don't call in for your morning prayers.


01:08:10.280 --> 01:08:13.124
Well, it's just I get up so early.


01:08:13.280 --> 01:08:15.647
You know, I have to take
the bus every morning.


01:08:16.040 --> 01:08:17.371
At 9:00 a.m.


01:08:17.880 --> 01:08:20.804
Prayer starts at 6:00 a.m. every morning.


01:08:20.960 --> 01:08:22.849
All the sisters be on the line.


01:08:23.320 --> 01:08:24.970
I know you busy, baby. I know that,


01:08:25.160 --> 01:08:26.161
but you could call in sometime.


01:08:26.240 --> 01:08:27.321
Just once in a while.


01:08:27.480 --> 01:08:29.881
All right, I will. I will. How long you staying?


01:08:30.240 --> 01:08:31.321
Mm-mm.


01:08:32.160 --> 01:08:35.164
I done got on your nerves.
I'm sorry, please forgive me.


01:08:35.360 --> 01:08:37.488
You're not bothering me. It's fine.


01:08:37.680 --> 01:08:39.569
I'm just gonna go dry my hair.


01:08:40.520 --> 01:08:41.851
Everything all right, sweetness?


01:08:42.040 --> 01:08:44.042
Yeah. I just don't wanna catch a cold.


01:08:46.160 --> 01:08:49.164
That's not like her not to want her food.


01:08:49.680 --> 01:08:52.160
Yeah, I think she's mad at me, Miss Sarah.


01:08:52.560 --> 01:08:55.370
I forgot her birthday and now
I'm talking about her cooking.


01:08:55.840 --> 01:08:57.842
How you goin' forget her birthday?


01:09:00.360 --> 01:09:02.249
You need your ass whipped.


01:09:02.440 --> 01:09:04.283
Miss Sarah, you ain't supposed to be cursin'.


01:09:04.520 --> 01:09:06.568
That's the King James Version.


01:09:08.000 --> 01:09:10.367
It's all right, honey. Eat your food.


01:09:21.680 --> 01:09:22.886
You all right?


01:09:23.520 --> 01:09:25.045
I can't believe you.


01:09:25.800 --> 01:09:27.086
What did I do now?


01:09:27.280 --> 01:09:28.930
Why would you tell her all that stuff?


01:09:29.120 --> 01:09:31.600
She asked. And you know
how your mother is.


01:09:31.720 --> 01:09:32.881
I can't lie to her.


01:09:33.040 --> 01:09:34.087
Whatever.


01:09:34.200 --> 01:09:35.565
It's like she looks right through me.


01:09:35.800 --> 01:09:38.201
You know what? I'm going to bed.


01:09:39.400 --> 01:09:41.402
Do I need to go get my guitar?


01:09:41.880 --> 01:09:42.961
Good night.


01:10:01.560 --> 01:10:03.449
Is it important
for your partner


01:10:03.560 --> 01:10:04.971
to support your hobbies?


01:10:05.160 --> 01:10:06.810
Yes. I think
it's very important for me


01:10:06.920 --> 01:10:08.081
for that to happen, yeah.


01:10:08.680 --> 01:10:11.445
Yeah, I think over the years,


01:10:11.680 --> 01:10:15.605
with all my concentration
on my business, on success,


01:10:16.600 --> 01:10:19.843
I was afraid that I would give
up a part of myself, if I...


01:10:19.920 --> 01:10:21.126
Are you listening to me?


01:10:23.800 --> 01:10:25.689
Yeah, yeah, yeah. I...


01:10:25.920 --> 01:10:27.001
You don't want someone
that's gonna change you.


01:10:27.080 --> 01:10:27.842
Yeah.


01:10:34.800 --> 01:10:36.450
Oh! Come on!


01:10:36.520 --> 01:10:38.284
Babe, you see that?


01:10:38.480 --> 01:10:39.970
Don't throw the ball in all that traffic.


01:10:42.040 --> 01:10:43.166
Ah!


01:11:03.480 --> 01:11:05.801
So is this what you wanted, huh?


01:11:06.000 --> 01:11:07.240
You wanted to just have sex with me


01:11:07.320 --> 01:11:10.483
and just ignore me after that?


01:11:10.720 --> 01:11:12.006
<i>You come to the office.</i>


01:11:12.160 --> 01:11:14.970
<i>You don't say "Hi." You don't call anybody.</i>


01:11:15.080 --> 01:11:16.366
<i>HARLEY". You were the one that said</i>


01:11:16.440 --> 01:11:18.090
<i>you were married and
you couldn't do this, right?</i>


01:11:18.160 --> 01:11:19.241
Right?


01:11:19.320 --> 01:11:21.641
<i>Why does it even matter
if I call you or not, Judith? Really?</i>


01:11:21.880 --> 01:11:23.325
<i>Why are you doing this?</i>


01:11:23.880 --> 01:11:25.041
What are you talking about?


01:11:25.160 --> 01:11:26.207
I'm not a man that likes to play


01:11:26.320 --> 01:11:27.321
these little silly games, Judith.


01:11:27.520 --> 01:11:28.931
<i>I'm not playing any games.</i>


01:11:29.400 --> 01:11:33.200
<i>Well, if you want me,
then you say it. All right?</i>


01:11:33.840 --> 01:11:37.003
<i>Live for once in your life,
Judith, damn, come on!</i>


01:11:37.160 --> 01:11:39.162
It's not that easy. Okay?


01:11:39.320 --> 01:11:40.321
Where is he right now?


01:11:41.520 --> 01:11:42.760
He's watching the game.


01:11:43.000 --> 01:11:44.365
Touchdown!


01:11:45.160 --> 01:11:46.207
Yes!


01:11:47.000 --> 01:11:48.081
Put him on the phone.


01:11:48.360 --> 01:11:49.361
Will you stop it?


01:11:49.440 --> 01:11:50.680
<i>No, put him on the phone, Judith.</i>


01:11:50.840 --> 01:11:52.365
No. Just stop it.


01:11:52.560 --> 01:11:54.767
<i>Why doesn't he wonder who you're talking
to on the phone right now?</i>


01:11:55.120 --> 01:11:56.406
Because he doesn't do that.


01:11:56.600 --> 01:11:59.524
If you were mine, I'd want to know.


01:12:02.360 --> 01:12:04.522
Well, I'm not yours, am I?


01:12:05.040 --> 01:12:06.371
Well, you could be.


01:12:10.400 --> 01:12:12.209
Does he make love to you better than me?


01:12:14.880 --> 01:12:17.201
I don't think anyone
makes love better than you.


01:12:23.480 --> 01:12:24.891
Tell me you want me.


01:12:26.200 --> 01:12:27.281
<i>Say it.</i>


01:12:30.600 --> 01:12:31.886
I want you.


01:12:32.720 --> 01:12:34.245
<i>Come see me right now.</i>


01:12:34.920 --> 01:12:36.604
I'll pick you up
on the corner of Wilmont and 3rd.


01:12:36.800 --> 01:12:38.802
I can't. I can't be there.


01:12:39.080 --> 01:12:42.562
I'm making dinner. And it's what? It's 8:30.


01:12:44.120 --> 01:12:45.406
I just can't.


01:12:45.560 --> 01:12:48.325
Hello? Hello?


01:12:54.320 --> 01:12:55.970
Oh! Pass the ball!


01:13:03.600 --> 01:13:05.170
Dinner's ready, honey.


01:13:05.440 --> 01:13:06.885
Mom, I'm sorry, that was my boss.


01:13:06.960 --> 01:13:08.086
She just called.


01:13:08.240 --> 01:13:09.605
She needs me to run an errand.


01:13:09.680 --> 01:13:10.806
What?


01:13:10.920 --> 01:13:12.922
I know, it's ridiculous. I'll see y'all later.


01:13:13.080 --> 01:13:14.161
Well...


01:13:18.280 --> 01:13:21.045
- That happen a lot?
- No, no, no!


01:13:50.400 --> 01:13:51.686
Here you go.


01:13:54.280 --> 01:13:55.930
What's that?


01:13:57.280 --> 01:13:58.805
Oh, you really are from
the country, aren't you?


01:13:58.920 --> 01:13:59.921
You've never even tried this before.


01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:01.081
Let me give you a little bit.


01:14:01.160 --> 01:14:04.084
Oh, no, no, no.
I'm just gonna stick with the wine.


01:14:04.280 --> 01:14:05.406
You trust me, right?


01:14:07.000 --> 01:14:08.525
Of course.


01:14:09.400 --> 01:14:10.526
Go ahead.


01:14:13.840 --> 01:14:14.887
All right, Well...


01:14:15.160 --> 01:14:16.321
om


01:14:19.600 --> 01:14:20.681
I've been thinking.


01:14:21.440 --> 01:14:23.602
Instead of going into business with Janice.


01:14:24.200 --> 01:14:27.010
You and me, we should start
that marriage counselor thing.


01:14:27.640 --> 01:14:29.642
Get that office open. I'd do that for you.


01:14:32.320 --> 01:14:34.800
- Are you serious? Really?
- Yeah.


01:14:35.000 --> 01:14:36.240
You would do that?


01:14:37.040 --> 01:14:38.451
One catch, though.


01:14:42.360 --> 01:14:43.725
You have to be mine.


01:14:48.320 --> 01:14:49.367
Huh?


01:14:49.440 --> 01:14:51.408
What do I do about Brice though?


01:14:54.360 --> 01:14:57.091
Okay, uh, we talked about Brice, babe.


01:14:57.800 --> 01:14:58.926
You leave him.


01:14:59.200 --> 01:15:03.330
Harley, I already
feel so bad though, about what we're doing.


01:15:03.480 --> 01:15:04.686
Then why are you here?


01:15:06.560 --> 01:15:08.210
You know why I'm here.


01:15:08.920 --> 01:15:11.002
Why don't you just go home?
Get out of my house.


01:15:11.120 --> 01:15:13.646
Shit if I'm gon' try and play
these little games with you. No, go.


01:15:13.840 --> 01:15:15.171
What are you talking about?


01:15:15.400 --> 01:15:16.481
Go.


01:15:16.800 --> 01:15:18.882
You realize that you're
kicking me out your house.


01:15:19.440 --> 01:15:21.522
You know what? Fine then.


01:15:21.960 --> 01:15:23.803
Forget it. Asshole!


01:15:24.040 --> 01:15:25.166
Fine!


01:15:26.240 --> 01:15:29.164
Fine! Don't ever ask me to
cook or come over again.


01:15:29.240 --> 01:15:30.287
Bastard!


01:15:30.680 --> 01:15:33.843
Don't call me again, you jackass.


01:15:53.000 --> 01:15:54.923
You comin' in awfully late.


01:15:58.960 --> 01:16:00.962
- Where's Brice?
- What's wrong with you?


01:16:02.360 --> 01:16:05.921
Nothing, Mama. My boss made me upset.


01:16:06.160 --> 01:16:08.731
Brice is in the bed. What's wrong with you?


01:16:09.240 --> 01:16:11.527
I'm just gonna take a shower, okay?


01:16:12.040 --> 01:16:13.246
You been drinking?


01:16:15.080 --> 01:16:17.560
I had a glass of wine. All right?


01:16:17.800 --> 01:16:19.802
With that devil in the red car.


01:16:20.840 --> 01:16:24.686
No, not with him. And he ain't no devil.


01:16:27.400 --> 01:16:29.641
Who you think you talkin' to?


01:16:31.080 --> 01:16:34.289
You know you never could lie
to me. I'm your mother.


01:16:36.080 --> 01:16:38.287
God's not pleased with this, daughter.


01:16:41.480 --> 01:16:42.925
I knew when you moved here.


01:16:43.160 --> 01:16:46.130
I knew the devil was gon'
be after you. I just knew it.


01:16:46.600 --> 01:16:50.082
And look at you. You're fallen.


01:16:51.200 --> 01:16:53.248
Look at you, you're changing.


01:16:53.480 --> 01:16:56.290
Please, baby, come back.


01:16:56.960 --> 01:16:59.930
Now, you know I taught you
the ways of the Lord.


01:17:00.320 --> 01:17:01.731
You know better.


01:17:02.120 --> 01:17:04.646
Come on out here, now. Come pray with me.


01:17:04.840 --> 01:17:08.367
Okay, Mama. I'll come out
there and I'll pray with you.


01:17:08.960 --> 01:17:11.122
But then what? Huh?


01:17:11.400 --> 01:17:13.050
Am I supposed to stop wearing makeup?


01:17:13.240 --> 01:17:14.969
And wear dresses down to my ankle,


01:17:15.160 --> 01:17:17.561
and pretend like I'm all holy and happy,


01:17:17.760 --> 01:17:20.331
and sanctified for the Lord like you do?


01:17:20.520 --> 01:17:22.682
Nobody's pretending, baby.


01:17:22.880 --> 01:17:24.405
Yeah, well, I'm just saying


01:17:24.480 --> 01:17:26.482
it don't take all that to love the Lord.


01:17:27.240 --> 01:17:30.881
Why you so disrespectful to me?


01:17:31.120 --> 01:17:34.090
I'm just saying what my father
shoulda told you long ago.


01:17:37.560 --> 01:17:40.166
Now, you can just leave him right outta this.


01:17:40.360 --> 01:17:42.203
God bless the dead.


01:17:42.840 --> 01:17:44.410
God bless the dead?


01:17:44.600 --> 01:17:47.001
So, Mama, we're still doing that act?


01:17:47.200 --> 01:17:48.361
When you gon' quit it?


01:17:48.440 --> 01:17:50.966
We both know he's still alive. Yeah.


01:17:51.600 --> 01:17:54.843
I found him in Youngstown, Mama.


01:17:55.040 --> 01:17:56.690
And he told me all about you.


01:17:57.080 --> 01:18:00.368
And how you left him
the second you joined that church.


01:18:00.560 --> 01:18:02.289
How you kept him outta my life.


01:18:02.440 --> 01:18:04.124
So what do you gotta lie about it for?


01:18:04.360 --> 01:18:06.931
You trying to turn this all around on me.


01:18:07.360 --> 01:18:10.284
But it's not about me. It's about you.


01:18:11.040 --> 01:18:15.568
That fool out there,
'bout to make a bigger fool outta you.


01:18:16.240 --> 01:18:20.165
That boy is gonna hurt you somethin' bad.


01:18:20.360 --> 01:18:23.648
And he gon' take you straight to hell.


01:18:24.520 --> 01:18:26.488
Well, I'll enjoy the ride.


01:18:28.360 --> 01:18:30.408
Where you get that smart mouth from?


01:18:31.120 --> 01:18:33.805
How dare you talk to me like that?


01:18:34.600 --> 01:18:36.329
I done worked my fingers to the bone


01:18:36.520 --> 01:18:38.284
to make sure you had a decent life.


01:18:39.040 --> 01:18:41.042
I done cleaned more toilets
than you can think of and


01:18:41.240 --> 01:18:43.811
then you would talk to your mother like this?


01:18:44.680 --> 01:18:46.330
-- Not today.


01:18:46.840 --> 01:18:48.205
Not today!


01:18:48.400 --> 01:18:49.481
What's going on?


01:18:50.280 --> 01:18:51.884
Well, you know my mother.


01:18:52.120 --> 01:18:54.851
She feels that the devil is after me,


01:18:54.920 --> 01:18:56.729
so she in there hollerin'.


01:18:56.960 --> 01:18:58.246
"Yea,
though I walk through


01:18:58.320 --> 01:18:59.810
"the valley of the shadow of death,


01:19:00.040 --> 01:19:01.690
"I will fear no evil.


01:19:01.920 --> 01:19:05.208
"He maketh me to lie down
in green pastures."


01:19:05.400 --> 01:19:07.482
Brice, I need you take care of my child.


01:19:07.720 --> 01:19:09.802
I will, but tell me what's going on.


01:19:10.320 --> 01:19:12.004
God, Lord, Jesus and the Host.


01:19:12.200 --> 01:19:13.690
Judith,
what's going on?


01:19:13.880 --> 01:19:15.211
Please, not you, too.


01:19:15.680 --> 01:19:19.162
Judith, I've never seen
her or you act like this. Talk to me.


01:19:19.400 --> 01:19:22.051
Brice, okay, I just want to go take a shower.


01:19:22.120 --> 01:19:23.201
It's really not that deep.


01:19:23.440 --> 01:19:26.091
No, Judith, Judith, talk to me. Please.


01:19:26.320 --> 01:19:28.891
Judith, talk to me. Judith!


01:19:29.880 --> 01:19:30.927
Judith!


01:19:33.720 --> 01:19:35.529
Please!


01:23:00.400 --> 01:23:01.845
Wait a minute.


01:23:02.480 --> 01:23:04.642
Those are not my hand-me-downs.


01:23:04.840 --> 01:23:07.241
No, they are not. Take that for me.


01:23:07.440 --> 01:23:09.488
Oh, my God. You caught on.


01:23:09.680 --> 01:23:12.365
Wait a minute. Wait.
You caught on. Let me see.


01:23:12.480 --> 01:23:15.211
- I am so proud.
- Uh-huh. Like it? Yes?


01:23:15.400 --> 01:23:17.721
This is my finest moment in life.


01:23:17.920 --> 01:23:19.922
- Is Janice in?
- Yes.


01:23:25.520 --> 01:23:26.567
Hi.


01:23:27.720 --> 01:23:29.210
What, you don't knock?


01:23:29.760 --> 01:23:31.967
Just the person I wanted to see. Have a seat.


01:23:32.040 --> 01:23:33.087
No, I'll stand.


01:23:35.320 --> 01:23:40.690
I wanted to thank
you for the job, but this will be my last week.


01:23:42.560 --> 01:23:46.360
Ah. No. This is your last day.


01:23:47.120 --> 01:23:48.690
I just got a call from Harley,


01:23:48.760 --> 01:23:51.969
telling me that he's out of the deal with me


01:23:52.160 --> 01:23:55.448
and opening a practice for you.


01:23:56.400 --> 01:23:58.289
That's what we plan to do.


01:23:58.720 --> 01:23:59.767
We?


01:24:00.200 --> 01:24:01.281
Mm-hm.


01:24:04.160 --> 01:24:05.241
Little girl,


01:24:05.960 --> 01:24:11.046
you have no idea what you are in for.


01:24:13.080 --> 01:24:16.880
But I wish you all the best with your struggle.


01:24:23.640 --> 01:24:25.961
You know, I've been meaning to tell you,


01:24:26.440 --> 01:24:29.410
you are in an existential identity crisis.


01:24:29.600 --> 01:24:30.965
I did my research on you.


01:24:31.160 --> 01:24:32.286
You spent those two weeks in Paris


01:24:32.360 --> 01:24:34.203
and all of a sudden you got a French accent?


01:24:34.440 --> 01:24:36.329
Girl, we know you from Georgia.


01:24:38.440 --> 01:24:41.489
Bitch, you better get your ass outta my office.


01:24:42.920 --> 01:24:44.001
Now!


01:24:53.600 --> 01:24:54.761
That should do it.


01:24:54.840 --> 01:24:56.683
- Thank you.
- Thank you.


01:25:00.520 --> 01:25:02.010
What's going on? You okay?


01:25:04.240 --> 01:25:05.287
Yeah.


01:25:06.520 --> 01:25:08.090
Why are you so quiet?


01:25:10.400 --> 01:25:11.561
I'm sorry.


01:25:13.200 --> 01:25:14.645
Brice, what's the matter?


01:25:14.880 --> 01:25:16.120
Melinda, I'm fine.


01:25:16.200 --> 01:25:18.806
No, you're not. Come on.


01:25:19.400 --> 01:25:22.802
Everything you done
for me here, let me return the favor.


01:25:25.880 --> 01:25:27.245
What's going on?


01:25:29.160 --> 01:25:31.162
I think I lost my wife.


01:25:34.200 --> 01:25:35.690
I'm sorry.


01:25:36.440 --> 01:25:38.602
I'm so sorry. Are you sure?


01:25:40.560 --> 01:25:42.801
I can't even believe it.


01:25:44.440 --> 01:25:45.646
I don't know what I did wrong.


01:25:45.720 --> 01:25:47.722
I didn't know it was that bad.
I just thought that...


01:25:47.920 --> 01:25:50.890
Brice, sometimes we can
get comfortable with people.


01:25:51.120 --> 01:25:53.441
And that's what causes the problems.


01:25:54.440 --> 01:25:55.566
That's how it is.


01:25:55.640 --> 01:25:57.483
But I didn't even know she was unhappy.


01:25:57.680 --> 01:25:59.205
Well, she probably wasn't.


01:25:59.400 --> 01:26:01.528
Most times you're happy
until somebody comes along


01:26:01.600 --> 01:26:03.409
and shows you something different.


01:26:04.040 --> 01:26:06.202
Maybe I did take her for granted.


01:26:06.840 --> 01:26:10.322
Well, say you did. But this is wrong.


01:26:11.280 --> 01:26:13.965
This is wrong of her, man.
You don't deserve this.


01:26:14.720 --> 01:26:17.803
You can't take
the responsibility for what she did.


01:26:18.120 --> 01:26:19.201
Because when people cheat...


01:26:19.400 --> 01:26:20.811
I never said she was cheating.


01:26:20.960 --> 01:26:22.200
She's cheating.


01:26:23.120 --> 01:26:24.849
Miss Waco, I didn't...


01:26:25.040 --> 01:26:28.044
Calm down! But the lesbian is right.


01:26:29.160 --> 01:26:32.721
Lesbian? I'm not a lesbian.


01:26:34.320 --> 01:26:35.401
You're not?


01:26:35.720 --> 01:26:38.485
Oh, I'm sorry. I thought that you...


01:26:38.680 --> 01:26:40.762
The boots and the sweater.


01:26:41.800 --> 01:26:43.165
You know, she's met somebody


01:26:43.360 --> 01:26:46.967
that's making her look
at life differently. Face it!


01:26:48.280 --> 01:26:49.486
So what do I do?


01:26:49.880 --> 01:26:53.043
If you see a mob fighting with bricks,


01:26:53.240 --> 01:26:57.131
you don't join in the fight
unless you have one, too.


01:26:58.040 --> 01:27:00.042
Oh. May I help you?


01:27:01.600 --> 01:27:03.364
You have a prescription?


01:27:28.680 --> 01:27:30.648
Hey, I wanna go home with you.


01:27:49.840 --> 01:27:51.968
Judith!


01:27:53.600 --> 01:27:54.840
Hey, Brice.


01:27:54.920 --> 01:27:56.081
Come on, let's go.


01:27:57.160 --> 01:27:58.446
Go home.


01:27:59.080 --> 01:28:01.651
Judith, let's go, now! Get up!


01:28:01.880 --> 01:28:03.848
I don't think she wants to go with you.


01:28:05.080 --> 01:28:06.684
Judith, let's go!


01:28:07.760 --> 01:28:08.966
Baby, I'm getting tired of this.


01:28:09.480 --> 01:28:11.164
Baby? Get up.


01:28:11.800 --> 01:28:14.087
- Get up.
- Hey! Hey! Hey!


01:28:15.360 --> 01:28:16.566
Get offa me.


01:28:18.200 --> 01:28:20.202
Get your damn hands offa me!


01:28:21.360 --> 01:28:23.442
- Get offa me!


01:28:25.800 --> 01:28:27.404
What is wrong with you?


01:28:28.640 --> 01:28:30.005
Get your damn hands off of me!


01:28:30.080 --> 01:28:31.320
Have you lost your mind?


01:28:31.760 --> 01:28:32.886
Maybe.


01:28:33.680 --> 01:28:36.923
I'm at home waiting on you.
And this is what you're doing?


01:28:37.160 --> 01:28:39.083
Well, stop waiting, Brice.


01:28:40.400 --> 01:28:41.845
This is how you do me?


01:28:42.960 --> 01:28:44.928
You're messing around with this clown.


01:28:46.880 --> 01:28:49.850
Baby, you don't know how much I love you.


01:28:55.680 --> 01:28:57.091
Baby, come home.


01:28:58.600 --> 01:29:00.125
If you come home,


01:29:02.280 --> 01:29:04.408
I promise you I'll never mention it again.


01:29:04.480 --> 01:29:05.720
Just come home, please.


01:29:09.840 --> 01:29:11.126
Please.


01:29:14.640 --> 01:29:16.404
Oh, you're such a good guy.


01:29:18.480 --> 01:29:20.801
And I really hope you find a nice girl.


01:29:23.280 --> 01:29:24.884
What are you saying to me?


01:29:30.840 --> 01:29:33.525
I feel so dead with you, Brice.


01:29:34.680 --> 01:29:35.886
I do.


01:29:36.400 --> 01:29:39.165
And I wanna feel alive. I wanna feel wanted.


01:29:39.280 --> 01:29:40.327
I don't.


01:29:41.120 --> 01:29:44.966
You took me for granted. You did.


01:29:46.520 --> 01:29:50.366
I don't just want a good guy.
I want a phenomenal guy.


01:29:52.480 --> 01:29:54.130
You're not phenomenal.


01:29:55.800 --> 01:29:59.122
What are you... What are you saying to me?


01:30:03.440 --> 01:30:06.011
We have someone I can pay


01:30:06.080 --> 01:30:08.526
to help you through this
and help counsel you.


01:30:09.440 --> 01:30:10.521
What?


01:30:14.360 --> 01:30:16.647
Judith, you're not saying this to me.


01:30:20.240 --> 01:30:22.129
I tried. I loved you.


01:30:23.560 --> 01:30:25.289
I wanted to love you.


01:30:25.600 --> 01:30:27.523
And I'm sorry if I failed.


01:30:29.280 --> 01:30:30.884
I'm sorry.


01:30:34.320 --> 01:30:35.526
Fine.


01:30:37.560 --> 01:30:39.688
I will help you pack your shit.


01:30:44.120 --> 01:30:47.442
I don't need anything. I'll just get my laptop.


01:30:48.800 --> 01:30:50.723
I have everything I need,


01:30:51.080 --> 01:30:53.287
everything I could ask for here.


01:30:56.440 --> 01:30:57.680
Bye.


01:31:48.120 --> 01:31:49.167
Here you go.


01:31:53.120 --> 01:31:54.724
How are you doing? You okay?


01:32:03.400 --> 01:32:04.401
No.


01:32:05.520 --> 01:32:07.522
I understand what you're going through.


01:32:09.680 --> 01:32:12.126
She was just so cold.


01:32:15.200 --> 01:32:16.929
She wasn't herself.


01:32:20.400 --> 01:32:22.846
Her mother warned me. She was right.


01:32:23.200 --> 01:32:25.123
Brice, I'm so sorry.


01:32:27.440 --> 01:32:29.090
I know this pain.


01:32:35.680 --> 01:32:36.966
What are you doing?


01:32:37.360 --> 01:32:39.601
We're not attracted to each other.


01:32:40.080 --> 01:32:42.048
Okay, you're just hurting
and you'll do anything


01:32:42.160 --> 01:32:43.321
to make the pain go away.


01:32:43.520 --> 01:32:45.841
Trust me. I've been there.


01:32:47.720 --> 01:32:48.926
I'm sorry.


01:32:49.680 --> 01:32:51.762
I know it hurts right now.


01:32:52.680 --> 01:32:55.286
And I'm not gon' lie to you,
it's gon' hurt for a long time,


01:32:55.480 --> 01:32:57.562
and it's gon' seem like it's forever.


01:32:59.640 --> 01:33:02.405
But you're gonna get through this. I promise.


01:33:05.440 --> 01:33:08.887
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.


01:33:21.560 --> 01:33:22.607
You coming up?


01:33:23.120 --> 01:33:25.168
Hell, yeah, I'm comin' up.


01:33:25.280 --> 01:33:26.611
I wanna see how this dude has you livin'.


01:33:27.280 --> 01:33:29.806
Well, he should be at work, so he's not home.


01:33:31.640 --> 01:33:33.244
Hey, move it!
You're blocking the road!


01:33:33.320 --> 01:33:34.321
Go around.


01:33:54.280 --> 01:33:57.489
Thank you, Jesus.
Thank you, Lord.


01:33:58.080 --> 01:34:00.082
Oh, my Jesus.


01:34:00.440 --> 01:34:01.680
We have to go.


01:34:01.920 --> 01:34:03.160
Forgive us our sins.


01:34:03.360 --> 01:34:05.931
Lead all souls to you, Lord.


01:34:06.160 --> 01:34:10.006
Especially those in most need
of Thy Divine Mercy, Lord.


01:34:10.840 --> 01:34:13.525
No, no. Let's have a little fun with this.


01:34:13.840 --> 01:34:14.887
Hello, Reverend.


01:34:15.000 --> 01:34:16.047
Save my child!


01:34:16.120 --> 01:34:17.531
Sisters.


01:34:26.000 --> 01:34:28.526
Oh, the Lord done answered
my prayers, sisters.


01:34:28.640 --> 01:34:30.642
- My child is home.
- I'm getting my computer.


01:34:30.800 --> 01:34:35.203
Sweet baby, please stay.
Please stay. You're not safe.


01:34:35.480 --> 01:34:38.006
I brought all the sisters here to pray for you.


01:34:38.120 --> 01:34:39.201
We need you to stay here.


01:34:39.280 --> 01:34:40.406
I'm fine, Mama.


01:34:40.480 --> 01:34:42.209
I know you think you
are, but you're not, darling.


01:34:42.480 --> 01:34:45.245
- Okay. We gon' go. All right? I love you.
- You're in danger.


01:34:45.400 --> 01:34:46.401
Let's go.


01:34:46.520 --> 01:34:47.567
No, sweetie.


01:34:47.640 --> 01:34:48.641
Mom, give me this.


01:34:48.840 --> 01:34:49.807
I need it.


01:34:49.880 --> 01:34:50.961
Please, stay here. I'm begging you.


01:34:51.080 --> 01:34:53.048
- There's something on this.
- Mama, we need to get...


01:34:53.120 --> 01:34:55.361
- Stop it!
- Damn!


01:34:55.520 --> 01:34:56.567
Satan!


01:34:58.920 --> 01:35:00.684
Give me that now.


01:35:01.080 --> 01:35:05.244
What the hell? Mama, you okay? You okay?


01:35:05.400 --> 01:35:07.767
- You're good, right? Stand up.
- My sweet baby!


01:35:07.920 --> 01:35:09.206
Now you see what I mean?


01:35:09.400 --> 01:35:10.606
No, he didn't mean it. He didn't mean it.


01:35:10.680 --> 01:35:12.330
You need to stay here with me, baby, please.


01:35:12.560 --> 01:35:14.767
- Get up. Get up!
- Get your hands off my baby!


01:35:14.920 --> 01:35:16.922
- I'm talking to her!
- Mama, hold on now.


01:35:17.160 --> 01:35:19.083
Get up. Girl, get up.


01:35:19.320 --> 01:35:23.245
Sister Sarah, you tried. You tried.


01:35:23.440 --> 01:35:26.683
I don't know if she's hurt.
I don't know if her bruised knee is okay.


01:35:26.760 --> 01:35:28.842
I don't know nothin' because
you just jacked me outta there!


01:35:28.920 --> 01:35:30.888
Bring your ass back here.
Come back here. You come back.


01:35:31.120 --> 01:35:33.088
Get the hell off me! Don't you touch me!


01:35:33.280 --> 01:35:36.602
- Whose side are you on?
- She's my mother, you jerk!


01:35:36.760 --> 01:35:38.603
I don't give a damn about your mama, Judith!


01:35:38.840 --> 01:35:40.604
Yeah, obviously, you don't!


01:35:41.240 --> 01:35:42.924
The way you pushed her down!


01:35:43.440 --> 01:35:44.930
- Get up the stairs!
- Don't touch me!


01:35:45.000 --> 01:35:47.048
Get up the stairs if I wanna get up the stairs.


01:35:47.800 --> 01:35:49.962
So you just gon' take her side like that? Huh?


01:35:50.120 --> 01:35:51.360
- Take her side?
- Yeah!


01:35:51.440 --> 01:35:53.408
This is not about me taking her side, Harley.


01:35:53.480 --> 01:35:56.051
It's the fact that
you will not understand what it feels like


01:35:56.120 --> 01:35:58.487
to watch your mother thrown to the ground!


01:35:58.960 --> 01:36:01.042
Look, just because your mother
abandoned you in some crack house,


01:36:01.120 --> 01:36:02.804
don't mean you gotta abuse mine!


01:36:05.280 --> 01:36:08.124
I don't give a damn what she did.


01:36:08.400 --> 01:36:10.448
It ain't about what she did.


01:36:11.640 --> 01:36:13.483
Shoot, yes, she annoys me,
too. She's still my mother.


01:36:13.720 --> 01:36:15.131
Where is my shit, bitch?


01:36:15.320 --> 01:36:17.004
She don't deserve to
be treated that way.


01:36:20.320 --> 01:36:23.642
Judith, you know that I'm just
crazy in love with you, okay?


01:36:23.720 --> 01:36:24.960
And it just...


01:36:25.400 --> 01:36:27.926
It just makes me really upset
when you're not on my side, okay?


01:36:28.000 --> 01:36:30.162
I'm gonna just
give you some space right now.


01:36:31.320 --> 01:36:32.481
You leaving?


01:36:36.320 --> 01:36:37.526
Judith?


01:36:38.520 --> 01:36:40.682
It's just, this really is not healthy.


01:36:41.520 --> 01:36:43.443
You gon' leave me? Hmm?
Is that what you gonna do?


01:36:43.520 --> 01:36:44.601
What the hell are you...


01:36:44.680 --> 01:36:45.841
Is that what you gon' do?


01:36:46.360 --> 01:36:47.771
What do you know about cooking?


01:36:47.960 --> 01:36:49.689
Boy, this is what I do.


01:36:56.120 --> 01:36:57.121
Thank you.


01:36:58.120 --> 01:36:59.531
Oh, don't mention it.


01:36:59.680 --> 01:37:02.604
I didn't want yo' ass to jump.


01:37:02.840 --> 01:37:04.171
I'm not gonna jump.


01:37:04.360 --> 01:37:05.361
Good.


01:37:07.680 --> 01:37:09.603
It hurts like hell, though.


01:37:10.360 --> 01:37:11.725
I know.


01:37:12.360 --> 01:37:13.885
I know where you are.


01:37:14.480 --> 01:37:16.721
You can cook. You're a good woman.


01:37:18.000 --> 01:37:19.968
You think you'll ever find love again?


01:37:22.480 --> 01:37:24.528
You can't run from that guy forever.


01:37:25.360 --> 01:37:27.522
I believe in love and marriage and


01:37:28.640 --> 01:37:30.802
I really hope you find a nice guy.


01:37:38.240 --> 01:37:39.480
Brice...


01:37:40.840 --> 01:37:42.410
I have HIV.


01:37:57.000 --> 01:37:58.081
Melinda, I'm sorry.


01:37:58.200 --> 01:37:59.247
It's okay.


01:38:00.000 --> 01:38:01.604
I'm dealing with it.


01:38:02.760 --> 01:38:04.569
I made the choice to be with my ex.


01:38:05.080 --> 01:38:07.526
Even though I knew he was
sleeping around, so


01:38:08.160 --> 01:38:10.162
I accepted my part in it.


01:38:11.040 --> 01:38:13.281
I'm taking my meds, so I'm doing good.


01:38:17.120 --> 01:38:19.009
But to answer your question...


01:38:19.560 --> 01:38:23.246
No. I'm not running from Harley anymore.


01:38:25.600 --> 01:38:26.761
Harley?


01:38:27.040 --> 01:38:28.883
Yeah, the Class-Meet guy.


01:38:34.120 --> 01:38:35.281
- What's wrong?
- Judith.


01:38:35.520 --> 01:38:37.921
- What? What's the matter?
- Judith!


01:38:38.120 --> 01:38:40.122
- Judith!
- Judith? What about Judith?


01:38:40.280 --> 01:38:41.805
My Wife is with him!


01:38:41.960 --> 01:38:43.803
Okay, okay. Oh, my God.


01:39:19.480 --> 01:39:20.686
Judith!


01:39:23.320 --> 01:39:24.401
Judith!


01:39:45.840 --> 01:39:47.126
No. No, no, no, no.


01:39:47.520 --> 01:39:50.888
Judith, baby, it's me. It's Brice.


01:39:51.000 --> 01:39:52.365
-- No, no, no, it's me.


01:39:53.520 --> 01:39:55.648
I'm gonna take you home.
I'm taking you home.


01:39:55.960 --> 01:39:57.200
It's me, baby.


01:39:59.200 --> 01:40:00.326
Brice!


01:40:00.880 --> 01:40:01.881
Yeah.


01:40:02.040 --> 01:40:03.041
I knew you'd come.


01:40:03.280 --> 01:40:04.645
He did this to you?


01:40:05.560 --> 01:40:06.721
I deserve it.


01:40:06.960 --> 01:40:08.041
You don't deserve this.


01:40:08.280 --> 01:40:10.282
- Yes, I do.
- No, you don't.


01:40:11.200 --> 01:40:13.521
I was so mean to you.


01:40:15.120 --> 01:40:16.884
I'm so sorry.


01:40:17.880 --> 01:40:19.644
I'm so sorry.


01:40:20.040 --> 01:40:23.169
You think we can fix it? We can fix it, right?


01:40:23.560 --> 01:40:25.244
We'll fix it.


01:40:26.360 --> 01:40:27.486
Okay.


01:40:28.800 --> 01:40:31.087
Where are you hurt?


01:40:33.400 --> 01:40:34.640
Right here.


01:40:39.240 --> 01:40:40.765
I hurt your heart.


01:40:48.720 --> 01:40:49.767
It's okay.


01:40:52.240 --> 01:40:53.924
Come on, babe, I'm gonna get you home.


01:40:55.520 --> 01:40:57.090
I'm gonna get you outta here.


01:40:59.560 --> 01:41:01.244
I'm gonna get you outta here. Come on.


01:41:08.760 --> 01:41:09.841
It's okay.


01:41:12.560 --> 01:41:14.050
<i>I got you. I got you.</i>


01:41:18.920 --> 01:41:19.967
<i>I got you.</i>


01:41:21.960 --> 01:41:23.041
My God!


01:41:24.440 --> 01:41:25.441
Careful.


01:41:34.640 --> 01:41:35.641
Get up.


01:41:36.440 --> 01:41:37.487
Get up!


01:41:58.160 --> 01:41:59.241
Oh, my God.


01:42:00.840 --> 01:42:03.002
Brice, stop, you gon' kill him.


01:42:15.600 --> 01:42:16.647
Karen.


01:42:18.520 --> 01:42:19.521
Yeah.


01:42:20.840 --> 01:42:22.285
It's me, Karen.


01:42:23.440 --> 01:42:25.090
I knew you'd come back.


01:42:28.360 --> 01:42:29.771
Come here, girl.


01:42:29.960 --> 01:42:32.770
Don't you ever come
near her or my wife again.


01:42:34.360 --> 01:42:35.850
Karen. Karen.


01:42:47.480 --> 01:42:49.642
I'm sorry. I know you have to go.


01:42:50.360 --> 01:42:51.361
Wow.


01:42:54.000 --> 01:42:55.570
What happened to Judith?


01:43:02.200 --> 01:43:03.201
Well...


01:43:04.120 --> 01:43:05.531
She's alive.


01:43:06.560 --> 01:43:08.244
How does this story end?


01:43:08.880 --> 01:43:10.484
It's still being written.


01:43:13.800 --> 01:43:15.564
Did she get HIV, too?


01:43:20.200 --> 01:43:21.247
Yes.


01:43:22.560 --> 01:43:23.641
Brice?


01:43:24.920 --> 01:43:25.921
No.


01:43:27.400 --> 01:43:30.085
Thank you so much for
sharing this story with me.


01:43:32.160 --> 01:43:35.209
I'm gonna end
this "almost" affair and stay with my husband.


01:44:09.120 --> 01:44:11.088
Karen. Hey.


01:44:11.280 --> 01:44:12.770
Hi. How are you?


01:44:13.200 --> 01:44:14.201
Good to see you.


01:44:14.280 --> 01:44:15.361
Hi. ls Brice here?


01:44:15.440 --> 01:44:16.441
- Yeah. He's in the back.
- Okay.


01:44:16.560 --> 01:44:18.085
- Thanks.
- Good seeing you.


01:44:18.280 --> 01:44:20.282
- You look nice.
- Thank you.


01:44:23.280 --> 01:44:24.327
Hi.


01:44:24.800 --> 01:44:25.801
Hi.


01:44:26.120 --> 01:44:27.121
How are you?


01:44:28.080 --> 01:44:30.048
I'm good. I spoke to your doctor.


01:44:30.280 --> 01:44:32.760
He changed your dosage
to get your T-cell count up.


01:44:33.120 --> 01:44:34.121
Okay.


01:44:35.160 --> 01:44:36.241
How are you feeling?


01:44:36.320 --> 01:44:37.651
I'm fine. I'm good.


01:44:38.480 --> 01:44:39.481
Where you headed to?


01:44:39.720 --> 01:44:42.803
I'm going to church.
Mama's there waiting for me.


01:44:43.080 --> 01:44:45.003
Okay. Well, be careful.


01:44:46.280 --> 01:44:48.931
And if you ever need anything,
I'm here for you, Judith.


01:44:51.800 --> 01:44:54.326
- See you next month.
- I'll see you next month.


01:44:58.160 --> 01:44:59.924
- Hi.
- Hey.


01:45:01.280 --> 01:45:02.611
Hi, little man.


01:45:02.840 --> 01:45:03.921
He's so cute.


01:45:04.000 --> 01:45:05.604
- Hi.
- How are you?


01:45:06.120 --> 01:45:07.360
Hey-


01:45:08.360 --> 01:45:09.361
How's my little man?


01:45:09.480 --> 01:45:10.527
Hey, Daddy.


01:45:10.640 --> 01:45:12.210
- Hey, babe.
- Hey, baby.


01:45:12.520 --> 01:45:14.284
- How's your day?
- Good.

